        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 1 IETF RFC 4291 has been updated by IETF RFC 5952, IETF RFC 6052, IETF RFC 7136, IETF RFC 7346, IETF RFC 7371 and IETF RFC 8064. These updates are considered to be included in this document.",
