        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The transmission control protocol (TCP) allows applications of V2G entities to establish a reliable data connection to other entities in order to exchange data in a reliable way and in-order. Additionally, TCP provides flow control and congestion control and also provides for various algorithms to handle congestion and influence flow control.",
